# Parameters of the mainnet activation rehearsal (SAHARA has 18 decimals).

# Timelock. The stack is activated under a 24 h delay; once the small batch passed and every reserve is in the Manager,
# Governance raises the delay to 72 h (05-delay-72h.sh). MINIMUM_DELAY is immutable and stays the floor of every later
# updateDelay; script/Deploy.s.sol refuses a floor below one day.
TIMELOCK_DELAY=86400            # 24 h: activation delay
TIMELOCK_MINIMUM_DELAY=86400    # 24 h: immutable floor
TIMELOCK_MAXIMUM_DELAY=2592000  # 30 days: immutable ceiling
FINAL_TIMELOCK_DELAY=259200     # 72 h: delay after activation

# Operating parameters: PLACEHOLDERS (the values test/fork/ScriptRun.t.sol uses). Production values are still TBD per
# the design document; replace them before the real handover.
POOL_MINIMUM=20000000000000000000000000                # 20M
REFILL_TRIGGER=50000000000000000000000000              # 50M
REFILL_TARGET=100000000000000000000000000              # 100M
MAX_FUNDING_PER_CALL=25000000000000000000000000        # 25M
AGGREGATE_FUNDING_CAPACITY=100000000000000000000000000 # 100M
AGGREGATE_FUNDING_RATE=1157407407407407407407          # 100M / day
POOL_FUNDING_CAPACITY=50000000000000000000000000       # 50M
POOL_FUNDING_RATE=578703703703703703703                # 50M / day
MAX_RECALL_PER_CALL=25000000000000000000000000         # 25M
RECALL_CAPACITY=50000000000000000000000000             # 50M
RECALL_RATE=578703703703703703703                      # 50M / day

# Activation amounts.
SMALL_BATCH=${SMALL_BATCH:-1000000000000000000000000}           # 1M: moved in, funded into the pool and recalled under the 24 h delay
BRIDGE_AMOUNT=${BRIDGE_AMOUNT:-1000000000000000000000}          # 1k: simulated CCIP release + lock through the handed-over pool
# Reserve wallets: comma-separated addresses whose whole SAHARA balance moves into the Manager. Empty = one simulated
# wallet (RESERVE_WALLET in accounts.env) whose balance is set to RESERVE_AMOUNT on the fork.
RESERVE_WALLETS=${RESERVE_WALLETS:-}
RESERVE_AMOUNT=${RESERVE_AMOUNT:-1000000000000000000000000000} # 1B
